A glass building that farms by itself: every Planting Bed in its floor grows one crop, and the greenhouse harvests and replants it over and over.
# Building
A box 5x5 to 11x11 across and 4 to 8 tall:
- the twelve edges are Greenhouse Frame;
- the walls and roof are Pressure Glass (or frame);
- the floor is Planting Beds (or frame);
- one Greenhouse Controller in a wall, not on an edge, facing out;
- inside is air, except Grow Lamps hanging from the roof (the top layer inside).
Like the other arrays it starts without ports: set them on its frames with the Wrench in Port mode.
